# Multi-room navigation.
#
# Measured compass inputs take the player northwest from the bedroom into
# the foyer and southeast back to the bedroom. The
# compass is a 3x3 arrow grid at x 4..44, y 128..168; centres are x 11/24/37
# and y 135/148/161.
#
# Note the Foyer lives in the same XANTH_02.PIC as the bedroom, so a room
# change shows up as a scene change rather than a new file being opened.

run 60
key 32
run 40
key 32
run 40
key 32
run 60
move 305 196
run 15
checkpoint bedroom

# NW -> Foyer
move 11 135
run 5
click left
run 30
move 305 196
run 12
checkpoint foyer
shot build/frames/nav_foyer.bmp

# SE -> back to the bedroom
move 37 161
run 5
click left
run 30
move 305 196
run 12
checkpoint back_in_bedroom
shot build/frames/nav_back.bmp
